{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54793","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占北斗，赤气在其中。\n万万雄风（辛本作「师」、川本作「帅」、京本作「兵」）徒（京本作「多」）费力，攻城尽死不成功，枉把库厫空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}